OL,3,GNEWSAPolice get more powers to tackle
OL,4,Anuisance vehicles
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice officers in North East
OL,7,FLincolnshire have been given more
OL,8,Fpowers to intervene in anti-social
OL,9,Fbehaviour linked to nuisance vehicles.
OL,11,FNorth East Lincolnshire Council has
OL,12,Fapproved a new Public Space Protection
OL,13,FOrder (PSPO) to improve safety for
OL,14,Fresidents and address issues caused by
OL,15,Fanti-social driving and the illegal use
OL,16,Fof e-scooters in public areas.
OL,18,FRestrictions under the PSPO include
OL,19,Fvehicle racing, excessive acceleration
OL,20,Fand braking and the use of e-scooters
OL,21,Fon footpaths and pavements.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,387,380,200,160,0,100
