OL,3,GNEWSAPolice get more powers to tackle
OL,4,Anuisance vehicles
OL,5,
OL,6,FOliver Freeston, leader of the council,
OL,7,Fsaid: "People should not be made to
OL,8,Ffeel unsafe in the neighbourhoods in
OL,9,Fwhich they live."
